{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute [[cite:obs-f84fd8482cede9d59f6af0958f6e57b3792e3e33 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years and are shredded afterwards [[cite:obs-d35737affb933fcc7aa4d3a28b8411d144bb2271 \"Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the statute's retention rule and the duration for which records are kept, with exact citations from the statute and schedule sources."}